description = Color([PAWN_nameDef] was a lord on a pre-industrial planet. [PAWN_pronoun] went to parties, managed the underlings, and even learned some swordplay.\n\n[PAWN_possessive] soft hands did not hold a tool once during that entire time. Now, [PAWN_pronoun] considers manual labor to be beneath [PAWN_objective].)
